<title>POLAND: NFI units soar in heavy continuous trade.</title>
<headline>NFI units soar in heavy continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish NFI units surged 6.7 percent in heavy 2.7-million zloty turnover in Warsaw bourse continuous trade.</p>
<p>BIG, Debica and Elektrim closed flat in total turnover of 301,250 zlotys, up from Thursday's 87,900 zlotys.</p>
<p>BPH and Rolimpex did not trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
